{
  "_comment": "Models for the dev distro. chat = llama.cpp models behind llama-swap (files in <ModelsWin>\\llm\\<id>; 'local_copy': true would also keep a copy inside the distro - unused: the owner keeps every model only on D: and accepts slower loading, ~2.5x slower answers for the 35B MoE); media = ComfyUI files (kept in <ModelsWin>\\comfy). Find a repo either by 'repo' (pinned) or by 'search' + 'must' (most-downloaded match). 'quant' = preferred file quantisations, first match wins. 'args' = extra llama-server flags ({moe} = tuned expert offload). 'vision' loads the image projector. 'ttl' = seconds idle before unload. weights_from = reuse the named model's existing D: files without copying or downloading; context/hardware settings remain a separate server entry.",
